  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **THOUSAND SONS** as your Army Faction, as your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-shooting-phase) begins, your models with this ability may attempt Rituals. For each attempt, pick one of those models that has made no Ritual attempt yet this turn, and a Ritual your army has not yet tried this turn. That model then takes a Psychic test:\n\n1. **Roll 2D6** to start the test.\n2. **Channel the Warp** if you wish, adding a third D6.\n3. If the final dice, after re-rolls, show any double or triple, the model's unit takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.\n4. Should the model survive, add up all the dice; at or above the Ritual's Warp Charge, it manifests the Ritual.\n\nRituals:\n\n- **Destiny’s Ruin** (Warp Charge 5): pick 1 enemy unit **visible** to the model and within 24\". For the rest of the phase, **THOUSAND SONS** and **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** models from your army can re-roll **Hit rolls** of 1 when attacking it, or any Hit roll on a result of 10+.\n- **Temporal Surge** (Warp Charge 6): pick 1 friendly **THOUSAND SONS** or **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** unit visible to the model, within 24\" and outside enemy **Engagement Range**. It may move up to D6\" with a **[Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**, or up to 6\" on a result of 10+, and cannot declare a charge this turn.\n- **Doombolt** (Warp Charge 7): pick 1 enemy unit visible to the model and within 24\"; a **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** unit outside an **Attached unit** must also be within 12\". It takes D3 mortal wounds, or D3+3 on a result of 11+.\n- **Twist of Fate** (Warp Charge 9): pick 1 enemy unit visible to the model and within 24\". For the rest of the phase, attacks against it by **THOUSAND SONS** and **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** models from your army improve their Armour Penetration by 1, or by 2 on a result of 12+.",
